## ASYNC TESTING (OBLIGATORIO PARA FASTAPI)

### MUST use pytest-asyncio para tests async

```python
import pytest

# Mark como async test
@pytest.mark.asyncio
async def test_async_endpoint():
    """Test async endpoint"""
    async with AsyncClient(app=app, base_url="http://test") as ac:
        response = await ac.post("/analyze", files={"file": test_file})
    
    assert response.status_code == 200
```

