## FIXTURES (RECOMENDADO)

### SHOULD use fixtures para setup común

```python
# tests/conftest.py
import pytest
from app.models.pipeline import Pipeline

@pytest.fixture
def pipeline():
    """Fixture que retorna pipeline inicializada"""
    return Pipeline(model_path="models/test_model.pth")

@pytest.fixture
def dummy_image():
    """Fixture que retorna imagen de prueba"""
    return np.zeros((224, 224, 3), dtype=np.uint8)

# Uso en tests
def test_with_fixtures(pipeline, dummy_image):
    result = pipeline.process(dummy_image)
    assert result is not None
```

