## ERROR HANDLING TESTS (RECOMENDADO)

### SHOULD test error cases

```python
def test_invalid_image_format():
    """Test that invalid images raise appropriate errors"""
    response = client.post(
        "/analyze",
        files={"file": ("test.txt", b"not an image", "text/plain")}
    )
    
    assert response.status_code == 400
    assert "must be an image" in response.json()["detail"].lower()

def test_pipeline_not_initialized():
    """Test graceful handling when pipeline fails to init"""
    # Simulación de pipeline None
    with pytest.raises(HTTPException) as exc_info:
        # ... test code ...
        pass
    
    assert exc_info.value.status_code == 503
```

