## MOCKING (AVANZADO - OPCIONAL)

### Para tests que no requieren modelo real:

```python
from unittest.mock import Mock, patch

def test_analyze_with_mock():
    """Test analyze endpoint without loading real model"""
    with patch('app.models.pipeline.Pipeline') as MockPipeline:
        # Setup mock
        mock_instance = MockPipeline.return_value
        mock_instance.analyze.return_value = {"result": "mocked"}
        
        # Test
        response = client.post("/analyze", files={"file": test_file})
        
        assert response.status_code == 200
        assert response.json()["result"] == "mocked"
```

