## INTEGRATION TESTS (RECOMENDADO)

### SHOULD test flujo completo end-to-end

```python
@pytest.mark.integration
def test_full_analysis_workflow():
    """Integration test: upload image -> analyze -> get results"""
    # 1. Upload real test image
    with open("tests/fixtures/test_face.jpg", "rb") as f:
        response = client.post(
            "/analyze",
            files={"file": ("test_face.jpg", f, "image/jpeg")},
            data={"confidence_threshold": 0.5}
        )
    
    # 2. Verify success
    assert response.status_code == 200
    
    # 3. Verify response structure
    data = response.json()
    assert "analysis_id" in data
    assert "results" in data
    assert data["status"] == "success"
    
    # 4. Verify ML results
    results = data["results"]
    assert "predictions" in results
    # ... more assertions ...
```

