## PARAMETRIZE (PERFORMANCE TESTING)

### SHOULD test múltiples casos con parametrize

```python
@pytest.mark.parametrize("confidence,expected_count", [
    (0.3, 5),
    (0.5, 3),
    (0.7, 1),
])
def test_confidence_thresholds(confidence, expected_count):
    """Test different confidence thresholds"""
    result = pipeline.analyze(image, confidence_threshold=confidence)
    assert len(result["detections"]) == expected_count
```

